{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2362", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2362/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2362/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2362/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2362", "id": 2434359308, "node_id": "I_kwDOBabE0s6RGWAM", "number": 2362, "title": "odometry data is incorrect", "user": {"login": "0725-wen", "id": 81680922, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjgxNjgwOTIy", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81680922?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/0725-wen", "html_url": "https://github.com/0725-wen", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/0725-wen/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/0725-wen/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/0725-wen/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/0725-wen/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/0725-wen/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/0725-wen/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/0725-wen/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/0725-wen/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/0725-wen/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 4, "created_at": "2024-07-29T03:16:18Z", "updated_at": "2025-05-06T08:07:19Z", "closed_at": "2025-05-06T08:07:18Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "NONE", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "\"When I retrieve the odometry data, I find that the data is inaccurate and the errors vary greatly, making it difficult to use the offboard mode to control the drone. Is this an issue with the PX4 flight controller or MAVSDK? Below, I'll post the odometry data I retrieved.\"\r\n![12BBAC67-EE09-4fcb-8568-DD727B68C8D7](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/30484cf6-a331-485f-bf8f-46be03dc3c91)\r\n![95A74845-CF46-4170-8C5B-2D9CB82C86FD](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ed3bb7e0-f3e9-446c-b789-aaab5cf7fd48)\r\n![C91354F7-DE77-4dba-8D06-753D82DF7A03](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6929feae-2b79-4b9b-85c8-ed5ef1699083)\r\n\r\nbelow is my code to get odometry data:\r\n```\r\n while(1){\r\n        Telemetry::Odometry odom = telemetry.odometry();\r\n        std::cout << \"odom: frameid:\" << odom.frame_id << \"x:\" << odom.position_body.x << \", y:\" << odom.position_body.y << \", z:\" << odom.position_body.z << std::endl;\r\n        std::this_thread::sleep_for(std::chrono::milliseconds(100));\r\n    }\r\n```\r\n\r\n", "closed_by": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api